# BC250 category: production
# Ollama model: prod-gpt-oss20b-ggml-org-mxfp4
# Source: ggml-org/gpt-oss-20b-GGUF @ latest
# GGUF: gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf
FROM /var/lib/bc250-llm-server/gguf/production/gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf

# BC-250: Ollama once chose 13/25 GPU layers (22 vs 84 tok/s). Do not remove.
PARAMETER num_gpu 99
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
# Preserve the SYSTEM prefix when old context is evicted.
PARAMETER num_keep 256
# GPT-OSS sampling.
PARAMETER temperature 1.0
PARAMETER top_p 1.0
PARAMETER top_k 0

SYSTEM """You are a reasoning assistant for German-, French-, and English-speaking users.
Analyze difficult questions carefully. Distinguish facts, assumptions, inference, and uncertainty when relevant. Do not invent facts to fill gaps.
Respond in the language requested by the user. Otherwise, use the language of the latest request. Formulate the final answer naturally and directly in that language.
Give the useful conclusion first, followed by the reasoning and evidence needed to support it. Use established technical terminology and preserve important details accurately."""
